. 
. *CONSTRUCTION OF IGG INDEX USING PCA

. 
. ********************************************************************

. 
. 
. 
. * Socioeconomic sustainability indicators

. 
. global IGG_SOC fertility health_exp infant_mort water_safe sanit_safe undernourish pop_density GNIpercapitaPPPconstant20 AfricaInfrastructureDevelopmen gini_index_wiid life_expect

. 
. 
. 
. * Environmental sustainability indicators

. 
. global IGG_ENV forest_area arable_land pm25 fisheries_prod nat_resource_rent clean_cooking fossil_fuel_energy renewable_energy Mortalityfromexposuretoambie Welfarecostsofprematuremorta Mortalityambientozone Welfarecost_ambientozone CarbonintensityofGDPk
> gCO2e MethaneCH4emissionstotal temperature_change_c Grossvalueaddedatbasicprice

. 
. 
. 
. * Combine all indicators

. 
. global igg_indicators $IGG_SOC $IGG_ENV

. 
. 
. 
. * Display available indicators

. 
. des $igg_indicators

Variable      Storage   Display    Value
    name         type    format    label      Variable label
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
fertility       float   %8.0g                 Fertility rate, total (births per woman)
health_exp      float   %8.0g                 Current health expenditure (% of GDP)
infant_mort     float   %8.0g                 Mortality rate, infant (per 1,000 live births)
water_safe      float   %8.0g                 People using safely managed drinking water services (% of population)
sanit_safe      float   %8.0g                 People using safely managed sanitation services (% of population)
undernourish    float   %8.0g                 Prevalence of undernourishment (% of population)
pop_density     float   %8.0g                 Population density (people per sq. km of land area)
GNIpercapita~20 double  %10.0g                GNI per capita, PPP (constant 2021 international $)
AfricaInfrast~n double  %10.0g                Africa Infrastructure Development Index (AIDI) Index
gini_index_wiid double  %10.0g                gini_index_wiid
life_expect     float   %8.0g                 Life expectancy at birth, total (years)
forest_area     float   %8.0g                 Forest area (% of land area)
arable_land     float   %8.0g                 Arable land (% of land area)
pm25            float   %8.0g                 PM2.5 air pollution, mean annual exposure (micrograms per cubic meter)
fisheries_prod  double  %8.0g                 Total fisheries production (metric tons)
nat_resource_~t float   %8.0g                 Total natural resources rents (% of GDP)
clean_cooking   float   %8.0g                 Access to clean fuels and technologies for cooking (% of population)
fossil_fuel_e~y float   %8.0g                 Fossil fuel energy consumption (% of total)
renewable_ene~y float   %8.0g                 Renewable energy consumption (% of total final energy consumption)
Mortalityfrom~e double  %10.0g                Mortality from exposure to ambient PM2.5 (Deaths per 1,000,000 inhabitants)
Welfarecostso~a double  %10.0g                Welfare costs of premature mortalities from exposure to ambient PM2.5(Percentage
Mortalityambi~e double  %10.0g                Mortality from exposure to ambient ozone(Deaths per 1,000,000 inhabitants)
Welfarecost_a~e double  %10.0g                Welfare costs of premature mortalities from exposure to ambient ozone(Percentage
Carbonintens~2e double  %10.0g                Carbon intensity of GDP (kg CO2e per 2021 PPP $ of GDP)
MethaneCH4emi~l double  %10.0g                Methane (CH4) emissions (total) excluding LULUCF (Mt CO2e)
temperature_c~c double  %10.0g                temperature_change_c
Grossvalueadd~e double  %10.0g                Gross value added at basic prices (GVA) (constant 2015 US$)

. 
. 
. 
. ********************** Factor test of inter-correlations **********************

. 
. factortest $igg_indicators
    
Determinant of the correlation matrix
Det                =     0.000
 
 
Bartlett test of sphericity
    
Chi-square         =         29979.604
Degrees of freedom =               351
p-value            =             0.000
H0: variables are not intercorrelated
 
 
Kaiser-Meyer-Olkin Measure of Sampling Adequacy
KMO               =     0.762
 

. 
. 
. 
. ********************** Correlation Matrix **********************

. 
. quietly estpost correlate $igg_indicators, matrix listwise

. 
. esttab using "Tables/Table_A1_IGG_Correlation.rtf", unstack not noobs compress replace title("Appendix Table A1: Correlation Matrix of IGG Indicators")
(file Tables/Table_A1_IGG_Correlation.rtf not found)
(output written to Tables/Table_A1_IGG_Correlation.rtf)

